 # tags: rfd:feature
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2491) 'DeltaNet layers hold a 32-bit RISC-V processor, and the server's recurrent state is its memory
 # tags: rfd:feature
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2491) 'the chip tower as a component of the Bonsai 2 `.ninfer` artifact, the qwenputer compiler
 # tags: rfd:scope
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2491) 'that writes it, the ninfer-all converter and engine that store and run it, and the calc firmware
 # tags: rfd:scope
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2491) 'Can Bonsai 2 answer an arithmetic tool call with no program outside its own weights?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2491) '
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2491) 'A tool call leaves the model: the host parses it, runs a program and writes the answer back.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2491) 'A compiler can instead write a processor as transformer layers, and then no host runs anything.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2491) '
