 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2491) 'Bonsai 2 runs a RISC-V machine in its own layers
 # tags: rfd:details-title
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2491) 'The Bonsai 2 artifact carries a chip tower: an RV32IM processor with the Zba extension, compiled
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2491) 'by qwenputer into eleven Gated DeltaNet layers of Bonsai 2's head geometry. The tower is its own
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2491) 'component beside the text tower. The ternary body is stored unchanged, object for object.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2491) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2491) 'The server runs every token through the tower. The tower names the next token where it owns the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2491) 'position, and the body names it everywhere else. A firmware is a recurrent state the server
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2491) 'loads, selected with `--chip`. The first firmware is the calc tool (operator, 2026-11-13).
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2491) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

