 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2491) '- RFD66606-2462 (the prism llama.cpp branch), a second runtime the same export can feed.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2491) '
 # tags: rfd:related
