 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:57Z (RFD66606-2491) 'the eleven layers under their usual names, the token table and each firmware's parked state.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

