 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-2491) 'compiler's bf16 check on the way out.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

