 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:05Z (RFD66606-2491) 'constants) by method `exact_direct`, which refuses a value the format would round. Each
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:06Z (RFD66606-2491) 'parameter is its own object. The converter refuses a tower whose head geometry or token offset
 # tags: rfd:details
