 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:40Z (RFD66606-2491) '  tensor is a bf16 value. Control: a weight that is not a bf16 value raises.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:41Z (RFD66606-2491) '- **Reference tower.** In stock Qwen3.5 modules, the residual after the chip layers equals the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:42Z (RFD66606-2491) '  circuit evaluator's on every kept dim at every position, token by token and as a chunked
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:43Z (RFD66606-2491) '  prefill, with the firmware state loaded after the prompt as a server loads it. The output
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:44Z (RFD66606-2491) '  code names the reference machine's next token wherever the machine owns the position.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:45Z (RFD66606-2491) '  Measured with the calc firmware: 17,387 positions token by token and 261,213 positions as a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:46Z (RFD66606-2491) '  prefill, each with no inexact position and no wrong token.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:47Z (RFD66606-2491) '  Controls: one flipped ROM word, one flipped MLP weight, and fp16 recurrent state each fail.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:01:48Z (RFD66606-2491) '- **Planes.** The planes of every matrix sum back bit for bit. Control: one flipped sign fails.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

