 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:06Z (RFD66606-2491) '  with `--chip`, without it, and on the engine before this work, for the same prompt text.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:07Z (RFD66606-2491) '
 # tags: rfd:details
