2026-11-13T00:02:42Z (RFD66606-2491) 'Open questions
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:43Z (RFD66606-2491) '- The n-gram drafter, MTP and DFlash are refused beside the tower. The n-gram drafter is the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:44Z (RFD66606-2491) '  larger part of the speed that a `--chip` server still gives up.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:45Z (RFD66606-2491) '- A malformed call shorter than a round can pass its closing tag. Preventing it needs a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:46Z (RFD66606-2491) '  partial commit of a round, which the engine does not have.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:47Z (RFD66606-2491) '- Each prompt token and each decoded token steps the tower by itself, also on a prefix-cache
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:48Z (RFD66606-2491) '  hit. Chunked calls would cost less, and whether the chunked ops are bit-exact on the tower is
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:49Z (RFD66606-2491) '  unmeasured.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:50Z (RFD66606-2491) '- A burst runs inside one engine unit, so a cancel is seen only after it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:51Z (RFD66606-2491) '- Thinking mode, streaming, the other endpoints, structured output and histories that hold
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:52Z (RFD66606-2491) '  earlier calls have not run with `--chip`.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:53Z (RFD66606-2491) '- How often Bonsai 2 writes a well-formed calc call on its own is unmeasured.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:54Z (RFD66606-2491) '- The tower is stored dense. The plane format above is not built.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

