2026-11-13T00:02:56Z (RFD66606-2491) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:57Z (RFD66606-2491) 'Bonsai 2 cannot do exact arithmetic on its own, and a host tool adds a round trip and a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2491  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-13T00:02:58Z (RFD66606-2491) 'second program to trust.
 # tags: rfd:details
